{"seq":3,"slug":"clauses-and-complex-sentences","title":"从句与复合句","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/clauses-and-complex-sentences","wordCount":1120,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"从句与复合句\">从句与复合句</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>英语中，简单句通过从句（Clause）组合成复合句（Complex Sentence），使表达更加丰富和精确。理解从句类型和组合方式，是从基础语法迈向高级表达的关键一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>从句</strong>（Clause）是包含主谓结构但不独立成句的语法单位。<strong>简单句</strong>只有一个主谓结构，<strong>并列句</strong>由两个或以上独立句用并列连词连接，<strong>复合句</strong>则由主句加从句构成。</p>\n<p>从句按在句中的语法功能分为三大类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>常见引导词</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>名词性从句</td>\n<td>充当主语/宾语等</td>\n<td>that, whether, what, who, when</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定语从句</td>\n<td>修饰名词或代词</td>\n<td>who, whom, which, that, whose, where</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状语从句</td>\n<td>修饰主句谓语动词</td>\n<td>when, if, because, although, so that</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示从句体系的分类：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S[&quot;句子 Sentence&quot;] --&gt; SIMPLE[&quot;简单句:一个主谓&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; COMPOUND[&quot;并列句:独立句 + 并列连词&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; COMPLEX[&quot;复合句:主句 + 从句&quot;]&#10;    COMPLEX --&gt; C1[&quot;名词性从句&quot;]&#10;    COMPLEX --&gt; C2[&quot;定语从句&quot;]&#10;    COMPLEX --&gt; C3[&quot;状语从句&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C11[&quot;主语从句&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C12[&quot;宾语从句&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C13[&quot;表语从句&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C14[&quot;同位语从句&quot;]&#10;    C3 --&gt; C31[&quot;时间 / 条件 / 原因&quot;]&#10;    C3 --&gt; C32[&quot;让步 / 目的 / 结果&quot;]\">graph TD\n    S[\"句子 Sentence\"] --&gt; SIMPLE[\"简单句:一个主谓\"]\n    S --&gt; COMPOUND[\"并列句:独立句 + 并列连词\"]\n    S --&gt; COMPLEX[\"复合句:主句 + 从句\"]\n    COMPLEX --&gt; C1[\"名词性从句\"]\n    COMPLEX --&gt; C2[\"定语从句\"]\n    COMPLEX --&gt; C3[\"状语从句\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C11[\"主语从句\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C12[\"宾语从句\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C13[\"表语从句\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C14[\"同位语从句\"]\n    C3 --&gt; C31[\"时间 / 条件 / 原因\"]\n    C3 --&gt; C32[\"让步 / 目的 / 结果\"]</pre><h2 id=\"句子分类\">句子分类</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单句</td>\n<td>一个主谓结构</td>\n<td>She sings.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并列句</td>\n<td>两个独立句用并列连词连接</td>\n<td>She sings and he dances.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合句</td>\n<td>主句 + 从句</td>\n<td>She sings <strong>when she is happy</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合并列句</td>\n<td>并列句 + 从句</td>\n<td>She sings when she is happy, <strong>but</strong> he stays quiet.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三大从句\">三大从句</h2><h3 id=\"1-名词性从句\">1. 名词性从句</h3><p>名词性从句在句中充当名词的角色（主语、宾语、表语、同位语）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"主语从句\">主语从句</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"What he said surprised everyone.&#10;That she passed the exam is great news.&#10;It is important that you arrive on time.  （it 作形式主语）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>What he said surprised everyone.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>That she passed the exam is great news.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>It is important that you arrive on time.  （it 作形式主语）</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"宾语从句\">宾语从句</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"I know (that) she is right.&#10;She asked whether I could help.&#10;I wonder what happened.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>I know (that) she is right.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>She asked whether I could help.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>I wonder what happened.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>宾语从句注意事项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>that 引导的宾语从句中 that 可省略</li>\n<li>从句用陈述语序，不用疑问语序</li>\n<li>时态需与主句保持一致（时态呼应）</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"表语从句\">表语从句</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"The problem is that we lack time.&#10;It looks as if it will rain.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>The problem is that we lack time.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>It looks as if it will rain.</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"同位语从句\">同位语从句</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"The news that he won the prize spread quickly.&#10;I have no idea when he will come.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>The news that he won the prize spread quickly.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>I have no idea when he will come.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>同位语从句 vs. 定语从句的区别</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同位语从句解释名词内容：The fact <strong>that</strong> the earth is round...（that 不作成分）</li>\n<li>定语从句修饰限定名词：The book <strong>that</strong> I bought...（that 作宾语）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-定语从句-关系从句\">2. 定语从句（关系从句）</h3><p>定语从句修饰名词或代词，由关系词引导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"关系代词\">关系代词</h4><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系词</th>\n<th>先行词</th>\n<th>从句中的成分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>who</td>\n<td>人</td>\n<td>主语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>whom</td>\n<td>人</td>\n<td>宾语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>which</td>\n<td>物</td>\n<td>主语/宾语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>that</td>\n<td>人/物</td>\n<td>主语/宾语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>whose</td>\n<td>人/物</td>\n<td>定语</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h4 id=\"关系副词\">关系副词</h4><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系副词</th>\n<th>先行词</th>\n<th>等价形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>where</td>\n<td>地点</td>\n<td>in/at which</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>when</td>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>at/on which</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>why</td>\n<td>reason</td>\n<td>for which</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h4 id=\"限制性-vs-非限制性定语从句\">限制性 vs. 非限制性定语从句</h4><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>限制性</th>\n<th>非限制性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逗号</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有逗号隔开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用</td>\n<td>限定先行词范围</td>\n<td>补充说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>that</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>省略</td>\n<td>不可（改变句意）</td>\n<td>可省略（不影响核心意思）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"限制性：The student who studies hard will pass.（只有努力学习的学生）&#10;非限制性：Tom, who studies hard, will pass.（Tom，他恰好很努力）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>限制性：The student who studies hard will pass.（只有努力学习的学生）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>非限制性：Tom, who studies hard, will pass.（Tom，他恰好很努力）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-状语从句\">3. 状语从句</h3><p>状语从句修饰主句的动词，表示时间、条件、原因等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"时间状语从句\">时间状语从句</h4><p>引导词：when, while, before, after, since, until, as soon as</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"I will call you when I arrive.&#10;She has worked here since she graduated.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>I will call you when I arrive.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>She has worked here since she graduated.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：时间状语从句中用一般现在时代替将来时。</p>\n<h4 id=\"条件状语从句\">条件状语从句</h4><p>引导词：if, unless, as long as, provided that</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"If it rains, we will stay home.&#10;Unless you hurry, you will miss the bus.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>If it rains, we will stay home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Unless you hurry, you will miss the bus.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>虚拟条件句</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>条件从句</th>\n<th>主句</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>与现在事实相反</td>\n<td>If + 过去式</td>\n<td>would/could + 动词原形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与过去事实相反</td>\n<td>If + had done</td>\n<td>would/could + have done</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与将来事实相反</td>\n<td>If + should/were to do</td>\n<td>would/could + 动词原形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"If I were you, I would accept the offer.&#10;If he had studied harder, he would have passed.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>If I were you, I would accept the offer.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>If he had studied harder, he would have passed.</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"原因状语从句\">原因状语从句</h4><p>引导词：because, since, as, now that</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Because it was late, we went home.&#10;Since you are here, let us begin.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Because it was late, we went home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Since you are here, let us begin.</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"让步状语从句\">让步状语从句</h4><p>引导词：although, though, even though, while, whereas</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Although he is young, he is very capable.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Although he is young, he is very capable.</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"目的与结果状语从句\">目的与结果状语从句</h4><ul>\n<li>目的：so that, in order that → She studies hard so that she can pass.</li>\n<li>结果：so...that, such...that → It was so cold that we stayed inside.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"长句分析策略\">长句分析策略</h2><p>分析复合句时的步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>找主句</strong>：先找出主句的主语和谓语</li>\n<li><strong>识别从句标志词</strong>：that, which, who, when, if, because 等</li>\n<li><strong>判断从句类型</strong>：是名词性、定语还是状语从句</li>\n<li><strong>画出句子结构</strong>：用括号标注从句范围</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[The book (that I bought yesterday)] is about [a scientist&#10;(who discovered (what no one had imagined))].\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[The book (that I bought yesterday)] is about [a scientist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(who discovered (what no one had imagined))].</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><ul>\n<li>从简单句开始，逐步添加从句，一层一层增加复杂度</li>\n<li>模仿英文原著中的长句结构，进行仿写练习</li>\n<li>分析阅读理解中的长难句，画出结构图</li>\n<li>用从句合并两个简单句，练习多种组合方式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>句子按结构分为简单句、并列句、复合句和复合并列句，从句使表达更精确丰富。</li>\n<li>三大从句是名词性从句（主语/宾语/表语/同位语）、定语从句（修饰名词）和状语从句（时间/条件/原因/让步等）。</li>\n<li>同位语从句解释名词内容而 that 不作成分，定语从句中 that 充当成分，这是二者的核心区别。</li>\n<li>分析长句的四步是：找主句 → 识别从句标志词 → 判断从句类型 → 用括号标注结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"从句与复合句","id":"从句与复合句"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"句子分类","id":"句子分类"},{"level":2,"text":"三大从句","id":"三大从句"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 名词性从句","id":"1-名词性从句"},{"level":4,"text":"主语从句","id":"主语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"宾语从句","id":"宾语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"表语从句","id":"表语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"同位语从句","id":"同位语从句"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 定语从句（关系从句）","id":"2-定语从句-关系从句"},{"level":4,"text":"关系代词","id":"关系代词"},{"level":4,"text":"关系副词","id":"关系副词"},{"level":4,"text":"限制性 vs. 非限制性定语从句","id":"限制性-vs-非限制性定语从句"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 状语从句","id":"3-状语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"时间状语从句","id":"时间状语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"条件状语从句","id":"条件状语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"原因状语从句","id":"原因状语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"让步状语从句","id":"让步状语从句"},{"level":4,"text":"目的与结果状语从句","id":"目的与结果状语从句"},{"level":2,"text":"长句分析策略","id":"长句分析策略"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时态与语态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/tenses-and-voice"},"next":{"title":"常见语法错误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/common-grammar-mistakes"}}